# sw090, a spare for a Saltwell pup yet to be born (test fixture).
mantle sw090
state ready
dialect saltwell
accent light
tier spare
title the well-drawer
fits stage=young|adolescent|adult|old
traits temper=calm talk=quiet warmth=warm humour=dry honesty=guarded piety=devout drive=steady
quirk hums_at_the_well
likes cool_mornings
fears sandstorms
hopes a_deep_well
topics faith +.3
marks oath

words
oath! = By the deep well | Sun keep me
greet = Cool water to you | Shade and water

young
line tell.boast : I can carry two buckets now. Full ones.
line greet.return : #greet#.
line farewell.return : #farewell#.
line react.news.new : #oath#!
line answer.how : Thirsty.

adolescent
line tell.self : I'm learning the pans. My arms hurt.
line greet.return : #greet#.
line farewell.return : #farewell#.
line react.news.new : #oath#. Truly?
line answer.how : Tired. The pans are hard work.

grown
line greet.return : #greet#. The well's sweet today.
line farewell.return : #farewell#.
line react.news.new : #oath#. Now that's news.
line answer.how : Well enough, under the sun.
